Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.16,0:00:05.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,what you could not finish.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.46,0:00:08.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pray Psalm twenty-three with me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will walk through Psalm
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,twenty-three line by line,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,praying over your needs,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,your regrets, your grief,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then gentle readings will
Dialogue: 4,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,carry you toward sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.86,0:00:25.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you have reached your pillow
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.53,0:00:28.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a conversation still unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a task still
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,turning in your mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.18,0:00:34.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring that unfinished day here.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders settle
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.21,0:00:38.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,as comfortably as they can.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.50,0:00:40.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to arrange
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,a perfect ending before you pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.34,0:00:46.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will walk through Psalm twenty three,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,one verse at a time,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.60,0:00:49.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,beginning with the One
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,who cares for you.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.94,0:00:54.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my shepherd;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:54.25,0:00:56.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I shall not want.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have come to the end
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.74,0:01:01.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,of what I can do today.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the messages
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.29,0:01:04.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,I could not answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.77,0:01:06.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work I could not finish,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.96,0:01:09.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the needs I could not meet.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive me here,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,with no polished explanation.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.80,0:01:16.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to know your care more
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,deeply than I know my own worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.05,0:01:21.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be my Shepherd in this quiet hour,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.60,0:01:22.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and teach me how
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.81,0:01:25.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive rest from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.18,0:01:27.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have spent today
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.94,0:01:30.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,being useful to other people.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.37,0:01:32.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,You answered, arranged, carried,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.83,0:01:33.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,remembered.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yet the first verse gives
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.83,0:01:37.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,you an identity that comes
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.77,0:01:40.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,before all of those things.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.08,0:01:42.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,You belong to a Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.30,0:01:45.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your place with him does not disappear
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.17,0:01:47.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,when your energy is spent.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you listen,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.50,0:01:50.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can stop measuring this day
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.86,0:01:53.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,only by what you accomplished.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also remember whose care
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.58,0:01:58.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,has accompanied you through it.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.16,0:02:01.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I am the good shepherd:
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.00,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the good shepherd giveth
Dialogue: 5,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his life for the sheep.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.34,0:02:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.90,0:02:10.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my practical needs before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.28,0:02:12.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the household expenses,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.81,0:02:14.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work I am seeking,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.60,0:02:16.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the decisions about
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.48,0:02:18.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I can afford.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.24,0:02:21.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom to distinguish a genuine
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.35,0:02:24.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,need from the pressure to keep up.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:24.37,0:02:26.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to ask for assistance
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,where I need it and to use
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.24,0:02:30.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I have carefully.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.08,0:02:32.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for daily provision,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.15,0:02:33.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,honest opportunities,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.82,0:02:35.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a heart that can
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.41,0:02:37.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive help without shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.05,0:02:39.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.44,0:02:41.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I compare my life
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,with someone else's,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.68,0:02:44.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lose sight of the gifts
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.62,0:02:46.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,already beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.31,0:02:49.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I lay down that comparison.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.55,0:02:51.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not know their whole story,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.96,0:02:54.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I cannot live their calling.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize the portion
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,entrusted to me today.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:59.05,0:03:01.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let gratitude grow without
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.21,0:03:03.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,denying anything difficult.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:03.76,0:03:05.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have enough,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.22,0:03:06.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,make me generous.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I am lacking,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.23,0:03:09.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me speak honestly
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.94,0:03:12.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek wise support.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.16,0:03:16.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next comes the line about still waters,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.15,0:03:18.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the work you are ready
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.15,0:03:19.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,to put down.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.97,0:03:21.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He maketh me to lie
Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.54,0:03:23.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}down in green pastures:
Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.74,0:03:27.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me beside the still waters.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.55,0:03:30.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd of my life,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,I set down the tools
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.85,0:03:33.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,of this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.14,0:03:35.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the screen, the list,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.58,0:03:36.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,the calculations,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.92,0:03:39.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the words I keep rehearsing.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.73,0:03:41.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the humility to stop
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.71,0:03:43.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,when my strength is spent.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.85,0:03:46.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,If something needs attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.60,0:03:48.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me return to it
Dialogue: 4,0:03:48.04,0:03:49.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,with wisdom then.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.57,0:03:50.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this hour,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my work before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.33,0:03:55.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my hands become quiet,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:55.47,0:03:57.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let my mind step away
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.54,0:03:59.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the unfinished page.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.10,0:04:01.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the wish that this
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,evening had gone differently.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.96,0:04:08.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I hoped for a calmer home,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.88,0:04:09.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,more time,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.73,0:04:12.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a kinder conversation.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.17,0:04:15.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the evening I actually have.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.29,0:04:17.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me among the ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.30,0:04:18.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,sounds around me,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.61,0:04:20.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,the light beneath the door,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.70,0:04:23.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the things still out of place.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a little room inside
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.95,0:04:29.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,my thoughts to remember your presence.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.18,0:04:31.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive this moment without
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.75,0:04:34.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,demanding that it be perfect.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.37,0:04:36.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,For a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.42,0:04:38.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,leave the list alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe naturally,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,without trying to reach
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.50,0:04:43.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,a particular rhythm.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:43.31,0:04:46.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice where you are supported.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.17,0:04:47.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your next breath
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,arrive in its own time,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.12,0:04:51.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,while this simple prayer settles:
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.68,0:04:54.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd, lead me into rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:56.15,0:04:58.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He restoreth my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.59,0:05:00.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me in the paths
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.63,0:05:03.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness for his name's sake.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.34,0:05:05.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.74,0:05:08.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name what needs forgiveness in me.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.94,0:05:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember the sharp answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,the selfish choice,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the truth I avoided.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.77,0:05:15.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am sorry
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the hurt I caused.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.82,0:05:18.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Forgive me,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,and make me willing
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.97,0:05:21.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,to repair what I can.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.77,0:05:23.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me distinguish honest
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibility from endless
Dialogue: 4,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,self-accusation.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot undo this
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,day by replaying it.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.09,0:05:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring it to your mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask you to shape a more
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.23,0:05:37.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,faithful response tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.76,0:05:41.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my next step, Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,If an apology is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me offer it plainly.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,If a boundary is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.65,0:05:50.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me speak it with steadiness.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.41,0:05:51.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I need to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.85,0:05:53.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,something I have avoided,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.74,0:05:55.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me courage to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.94,0:05:58.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from making grand promises
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,tonight that I have not considered.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.57,0:06:03.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me the quiet faithfulness
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,of doing one right
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing at a time,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,following the path you place before me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.27,0:06:14.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Soon we reach the valley,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.11,0:06:16.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you will not walk it alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.30,0:06:18.97,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall feed his flock
Dialogue: 5,0:06:18.97,0:06:20.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}like a shepherd:
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.42,0:06:21.52,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall gather
Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.20,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the lambs with his arm,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.20,0:06:25.24,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and carry them in his bosom,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.78,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and shall gently lead
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}those that are with young.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.48,0:06:31.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gentle Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the people who depend
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.87,0:06:35.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,on me and the weariness
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.61,0:06:37.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I sometimes hide from them.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.94,0:06:39.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me love them without
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.74,0:06:42.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,pretending my strength is endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.47,0:06:44.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me where I can
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,share a task,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.04,0:06:46.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask a friend,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.08,0:06:49.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,or accept another person's kindness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I feel guilty for resting,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:51.78,0:06:53.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me that I am also
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.71,0:06:56.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,a creature in need of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.19,0:06:58.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me receive tenderness as
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.46,0:07:01.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,readily as I try to offer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.32,0:07:02.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yea,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.61,0:07:04.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,though I walk through the valley
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will fear no evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.34,0:07:10.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art with me;
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.73,0:07:12.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy rod and thy staff
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.48,0:07:14.17,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they comfort me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.62,0:07:15.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.99,0:07:18.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the sorrow that feels
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.13,0:07:21.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharper when the house grows quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.02,0:07:23.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the person I miss,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.08,0:07:25.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,the change I did not choose,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.30,0:07:28.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the future that now looks different.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.76,0:07:31.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay near as I grieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not force a cheerful
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,ending onto a painful day.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the tears I have,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.86,0:07:40.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the words I cannot find.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me accept companionship
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.55,0:07:44.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,from people who can sit with me
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.79,0:07:47.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,without rushing my sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.17,0:07:48.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.74,0:07:50.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the unknown
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,that follows me into bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot see how the conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,will go or what the next
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.18,0:07:59.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,season will require.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.07,0:08:01.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage for the part
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.07,0:08:02.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,that belongs to me,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.43,0:08:05.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,and patience with what remains unclear.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.52,0:08:07.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive to wise
Dialogue: 4,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,counsel and practical help.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:09.93,0:08:10.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,For tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.86,0:08:12.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask you to meet me
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the uncertainty itself.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.71,0:08:16.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me remember that I can
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,speak to you from here.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.58,0:08:20.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember those I love
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,who are walking through
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.39,0:08:24.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,their own valleys.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:24.94,0:08:27.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot choose their steps
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.25,0:08:29.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,or remove every difficulty.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.87,0:08:31.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring their names
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.57,0:08:33.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you with love.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.43,0:08:35.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them faithful companions
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the help their
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.08,0:08:39.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,circumstances require.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.09,0:08:42.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to listen before I advise.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.37,0:08:44.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me a kindness I can
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.17,0:08:46.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,offer when the day begins.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:46.43,0:08:47.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I rest now,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust them to your compassion,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.37,0:08:53.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,with all that remains beyond my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.99,0:08:55.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.35,0:08:57.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,the table prepared for you,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.30,0:08:59.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the argument you keep
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.11,0:09:00.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,having in your head.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.46,0:09:04.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thou preparest a table before me
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.05,0:09:06.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the presence of mine enemies:
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.95,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou anointest my head with oil;
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.95,0:09:12.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,my cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.63,0:09:14.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.04,0:09:16.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the argument I keep
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.23,0:09:18.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,conducting in my head.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.32,0:09:21.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have imagined my answers many times,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I am tired.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.17,0:09:24.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me surrender the urge
Dialogue: 4,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,to win it again tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom about any conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.67,0:09:32.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,that still needs to happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect me from cruelty,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.78,0:09:37.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and help me keep appropriate boundaries.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.04,0:09:39.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a heart that can
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.05,0:09:41.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,seek peace without pretending
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.29,0:09:42.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,harm is harmless.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.90,0:09:44.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the rehearsed speeches
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,become quiet now.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.54,0:09:48.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.09,0:09:50.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pause over a particular
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.05,0:09:52.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness from this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.15,0:09:53.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,A meal prepared,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,a message received,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.92,0:09:56.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,a moment of laughter,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.58,0:09:59.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,or someone making room for me.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.26,0:10:01.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the gift I remember.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.95,0:10:03.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the person
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.50,0:10:05.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,through whom it came.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.17,0:10:08.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me notice ordinary provision while
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.19,0:10:11.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I still live among unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive this small
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,mercy with gratitude.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.35,0:10:17.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let it occupy a little more space
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.98,0:10:20.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,in my memory than it did before.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.03,0:10:22.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.41,0:10:24.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,let what I receive become
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness in my hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have patience to spare,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.51,0:10:30.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me offer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.12,0:10:32.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have enough to share,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice a real need.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.49,0:10:36.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have been forgiven,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.33,0:10:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,soften the way I speak
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.88,0:10:40.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,to someone who has failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.02,0:10:42.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not want abundance to mean
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.38,0:10:45.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,only gathering more for myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:45.04,0:10:47.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Form in me a generous life,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,with room for my neighbor
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.16,0:10:50.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the table.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.70,0:10:54.25,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely goodness and mercy shall
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.25,0:10:55.65,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}follow me all the
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.65,0:10:57.27,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}days of my life:
Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.27,0:10:59.40,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will dwell in the house
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.40,0:11:01.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the LORD for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.74,0:11:03.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faithful Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.86,0:11:06.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place tomorrow within your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.88,0:11:09.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot prepare for every possibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.84,0:11:11.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I do not need to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.89,0:11:14.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,tomorrow's prayers tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,When morning comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.65,0:11:18.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide the work and the relationships
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,waiting there.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize goodness,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:21.81,0:11:22.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.93,0:11:25.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and offer both to others.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.23,0:11:26.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the remaining
Dialogue: 4,0:11:26.92,0:11:29.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours of this night to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my life become
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.64,0:11:32.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place where I learn,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.37,0:11:33.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,day by day,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.24,0:11:35.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,to dwell with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.16,0:11:37.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,We are near the end
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.64,0:11:38.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the psalm.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.95,0:11:41.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Say these words of trust with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,I belong to the good Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:44.93,0:11:47.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring him a genuine need.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:47.98,0:11:49.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can receive rest without
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.90,0:11:52.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,earning it through exhaustion.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.40,0:11:55.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can return when I have wandered.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.35,0:11:56.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can speak to him
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the valley.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.18,0:12:00.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can receive kindness
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.06,0:12:02.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,while questions remain.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the day behind me
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the day before
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.70,0:12:07.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,me within his care.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.49,0:12:08.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am learning to trust him
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.00,0:12:12.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,with what I cannot carry.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose one unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,concern from today.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.95,0:12:18.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Name it simply,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.15,0:12:21.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,without opening the whole story again.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.49,0:12:23.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then pray:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.10,0:12:23.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.74,0:12:25.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place this in your care
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,for tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.70,0:12:29.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,If a practical step belongs to tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.84,0:12:33.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can take it when tomorrow arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.12,0:12:33.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,let that one concern rest
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.75,0:12:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside this one prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have given it a name,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.56,0:12:41.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you have brought it to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you would like
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,to mark that prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can type amen in the comments.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also leave
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.96,0:12:51.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,a prayer request there,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.57,0:12:53.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,and in our next night prayer we
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.73,0:12:56.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,will pray over the requests you share.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.69,0:12:59.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,We now move into Scripture for sleep,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,with gentle readings about
Dialogue: 4,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Shepherd's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can leave the screen alone now
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.59,0:13:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and listen with your eyes resting,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,if that is comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is nothing you need
Dialogue: 4,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,to remember for a test
Dialogue: 4,0:13:14.31,0:13:16.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,or prepare to say afterward.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.61,0:13:18.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The words can arrive
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,one passage at a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your attention wanders,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.42,0:13:23.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,return gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.93,0:13:25.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you remain awake,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.52,0:13:27.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have not failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.41,0:13:29.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is simply a quiet place
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to rest with Scripture.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.88,0:13:33.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Come unto me,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all ye that labour
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and are heavy laden,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will give you rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.73,0:13:40.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Take my yoke upon you,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and learn of me;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.21,0:13:43.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am meek
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and lowly in heart:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and ye shall find
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.63,0:13:48.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}rest unto your souls.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,For my yoke is easy,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.30,0:13:52.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my burden is light.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.06,0:13:54.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the burden of trying
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prove that I have done enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask you to teach
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.81,0:14:02.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,me your gentle way.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the rest
Dialogue: 4,0:14:04.59,0:14:06.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,you offer to my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.52,0:14:08.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave my unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,explanations before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.77,0:14:11.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my need
Dialogue: 4,0:14:11.94,0:14:14.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be understood in your hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:14.65,0:14:17.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this quiet time become a small
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,practice of trusting your goodness,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.63,0:14:20.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.86,0:14:23.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,and attention I have tonight.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.75,0:14:27.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For thus saith the Lord GOD;
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.54,0:14:29.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,Behold, I, even I,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,will both search my sheep,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.12,0:14:32.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek them out.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.88,0:14:35.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,As a shepherd seeketh out his flock
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the day that he is among
Dialogue: 4,0:14:36.99,0:14:39.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,his sheep that are scattered;
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.22,0:14:41.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,so will I seek out my sheep,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.08,0:14:43.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,and will deliver them out of all
Dialogue: 4,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,places where they have been scattered
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the cloudy and dark day.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.27,0:14:51.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow a little space between
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.26,0:14:53.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,one thought and the next.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:53.33,0:14:55.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can feel the pillow beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.59,0:14:58.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,you without adjusting anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.15,0:15:00.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in your ordinary way.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,For these few moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:02.60,0:15:04.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,let being here be enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.81,0:15:08.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,My Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.74,0:15:11.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave this day with you now.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.37,0:15:12.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the gratitude,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.85,0:15:14.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,the confession, the sorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the hope I have brought.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grant me rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.90,0:15:19.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and meet me with patience
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.81,0:15:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,if I am still awake.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.64,0:15:23.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the care
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.43,0:15:24.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,available to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the next breath
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.77,0:15:29.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the coming morning to your mercy.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.81,0:15:31.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have no further
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.24,0:15:33.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,words I need to add.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.22,0:15:34.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,I rest before
Dialogue: 4,0:15:34.30,0:15:36.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,you in the name of Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.68,0:15:38.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.68,0:15:41.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,May the gentleness of the good
Dialogue: 4,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd accompany your rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.39,0:15:47.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his mercy quiet the harsh words
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.07,0:15:49.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have spoken against yourself.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:49.90,0:15:52.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his presence be your comfort
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.31,0:15:54.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the hours ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.04,0:15:56.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,The prayer is complete.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest here,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.02,0:16:00.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,with this day entrusted to his care.
